No other library, framework, analytics, font file or network request is part
of this project. The page loads nothing at runtime, not even a copy of
anything from a CDN.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Fonts
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

No font file is shipped. The typed signature uses fonts that are already
installed on the device, chosen by name with generic fallbacks, so the text
is rendered by the browser's own text engine. If a device has none of the
named faces, the browser falls back to a cursive or serif face it does have.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Documents
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The documents opened in this tool remain on the device. Nothing is uploaded,
collected or transmitted, and this project has no server component.

The PDF fixtures in tests/fixtures were generated for this project, except
encrypted.pdf and broken.pdf, which exist to test refusals and contain no
real data.
